WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.280
- So many trees
- It's beautiful right?

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.400
It's definitely not Boston

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:15.840
Here we go. Okay. So what do you think?

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.000
Wow, this whole place is ours?

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.020
I even got 'em to throw in a
whole forest as a new backyard

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.560
It was a myth

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.600
Kids used to dare each other
to go into the woods at night

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.610
They knew the power of that place

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.410
They feared it

00:00:57.269 --> 00:00:59.269
Those woods

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.020
Belong to something else

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.020
The ground is bad.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.100
[man yells]

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:22.620
It may be just some crazy folktale

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:24.860
but there is something up in those woods

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.940
Something that brings things back

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.300
Sometimes dead is better

